{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1660,
    "dDurationMs": 4219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is Chernobyl nuclear reactor number four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5879,
    "dDurationMs": 4661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It melted down on April 26, 1986."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10540,
    "dDurationMs": 5650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what happened was so much heat was generated\ninside that reactor that it basically blew"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16190,
    "dDurationMs": 6820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the top off spreading radioactive isotopes\nthroughout this whole surrounding area and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23010,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over into Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25250,
    "dDurationMs": 8100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is why we can still detect the contamination\nhere today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33350,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they covered it in that sarcophagus which\nis kind of crumbling as it ages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37750,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so they are actually building a brand\nnew containment facility over here which,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42870,
    "dDurationMs": 4561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it is finished, will be slid over on\ntop of the old containment, on top of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47431,
    "dDurationMs": 5659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "old sarcophagus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53090,
    "dDurationMs": 4750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The town of Pripyat was built just a few kilometers\naway from the reactor, mostly to house the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57840,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "families of the people who worked there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61360,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now it is completely abandoned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64500,
    "dDurationMs": 9060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now you can find all of these high rise\nSoviet apartments completely empty and crumbling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73560,
    "dDurationMs": 8360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the forest is basically reclaiming this\nwhole town."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81920,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the residents of Pripyat were told to\nevacuate they were told that they would only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85850,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be away for two weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88420,
    "dDurationMs": 5090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they left most of their belongings exactly\nwhere they were and they never came back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93510,
    "dDurationMs": 12550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So their lives are on display here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106060,
    "dDurationMs": 22110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am inside an old kindergarten and it is\nincredibly peaceful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128170,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, you look around and it looks like\na disaster has hit here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132850,
    "dDurationMs": 8350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, mainly, what this shows is 30 years of\nweathering and no maintenance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141200,
    "dDurationMs": 43869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So things just fall apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185069,
    "dDurationMs": 7431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most insidious thing about radiation is\nhow invisible it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192500,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can’t feel it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194630,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can’t smell it or see it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198300,
    "dDurationMs": 7460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This could be pristine wilderness, but it\nis not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205760,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a contaminated, deserted waste land."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213200,
    "dDurationMs": 8259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what a real post-apocalyptic world\nlooks like: abandoned buildings, over grown"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221459,
    "dDurationMs": 15851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "streets, everything crumbling, rusting, breaking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237310,
    "dDurationMs": 4891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Near the reactor there is an area called the\nred forest, because after the accident, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242201,
    "dDurationMs": 5149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much radioactive material was dumped in that\narea that all the trees died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247350,
    "dDurationMs": 10419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And their leaves turned red, just like they\ndo in autumn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257769,
    "dDurationMs": 17671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am standing on the stage of the old Pripyat\ntheater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275440,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is something about this place that just\n... I can picture the scene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281500,
    "dDurationMs": 6590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can picture it here: a packed house, all\nthe great Russian productions that were staged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288090,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289090,
    "dDurationMs": 8520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you look around at all the old lights\nand the layers upon layers of walkways they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297610,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300880,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a pretty amazing location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304500,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is my favorite place so far, nothing\nradioactive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308760,
    "dDurationMs": 75930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is just an amazing look at the past of\nthis place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384690,
    "dDurationMs": 6860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything is so recognizable and so familiar\nand yet it is being destroyed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391550,
    "dDurationMs": 9589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is crumbling and nature is reclaiming this\nwhole area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401139,
    "dDurationMs": 6351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what the world would look like if\nman disappeared one day all of a sudden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407490,
    "dDurationMs": 12970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what it would look like 30 years later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420460,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I filmed this video while shooting a documentary\nfor TV all about how uranium has shaped the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424770,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "modern world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425950,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For details about when and where that will\nbe broadcast, check out the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429120,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thank you to everyone for writing in to\nrequest that this be broadcast in your area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432780,
    "dDurationMs": 4229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are working as hard as we can to make that\nhappen and/or to make it available online,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437009,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I know most of you watch most of your\ncontent online just like I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440729,
    "dDurationMs": 1311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we will try to make that happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442040,
    "dDurationMs": 4159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I really want to thank you for supporting\nme, because I think without your support and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446199,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the support of my long time sponsor, Audible.com,\nI don't think I would have been selected as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450479,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the host for this documentary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452570,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the part where I tell you about\nAudible, the leading provider of audio books"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455630,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in all areas of literature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456710,
    "dDurationMs": 5019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has got hundreds of thousands of titles\nin fiction, non-fiction and periodicals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461729,
    "dDurationMs": 5871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This week I wanted to recommend to you a fiction\nbook, which is The Martian by Andy Weir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467600,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you thought that that was an alien landscape—what\nyou just saw—imagine what would really happen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472820,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if there was a disaster on another world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475860,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is an awesome book and will be made into\na movie later this year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479070,
    "dDurationMs": 2909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you probably want to read it or listen\nto it before that happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481979,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can download this book for free by\ngoing to Audible.com/Veritasium or you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486039,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pick any other book of your choosing for a\none month free trial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488740,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I really want to thank Audible for supporting\nme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490990,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want to thank you so much for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
